# Diagrams folder for Online Cinema API

This folder contains project diagrams and visualizations.

Currently planned:
- `architecture.png` - Main project architecture diagram showing all system components and their interactions

This single comprehensive diagram will illustrate:
- Client layer (Web, Mobile, API clients)
- Load balancer (Nginx)
- Application layer (FastAPI, Celery)
- Data layer (PostgreSQL, Redis)
- External services (Stripe, SendGrid, MinIO)
- Monitoring tools (Flower)

